{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2611", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2611/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2611/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2611/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2611", "id": 3226807303, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s7AVSwH", "number": 2611, "title": "Double Unlock in LockedQueue::Guard", "user": {"login": "grantwilk", "id": 37308267, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjM3MzA4MjY3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37308267?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/grantwilk", "html_url": "https://github.com/grantwilk", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/grantwilk/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/grantwilk/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/grantwilk/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/grantwilk/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/grantwilk/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/grantwilk/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/grantwilk/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/grantwilk/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/grantwilk/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977267, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNjc=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/bug", "name": "bug", "color": "ee0701", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 4, "created_at": "2025-07-13T20:43:14Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-15T07:41:51Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-15T07:40:16Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "## Problem\n\n- The `LockedQueue::Guard` class locks the mutex in constructor and unlocks in destructor\n- `wait_and_pop_front()` manually unlocks the mutex, then re-locks with `unique_lock`\n- When the method returns, both the `unique_lock` and `Guard` get destroyed as they leave scope\n- The `unique_lock` destructor AND `Guard` destructor try to unlock the same mutex\n- This causes undefined behavior (double-unlock) that can crash/hang the program\n\nPersonally I experienced this causing indefinite hangs in my application.\n\n## History\n\n- First observed in v3.7.0 release\n- Does not reproduce in v3.6.0 release\n- Likely introduced in commit https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/commit/1abe3ea074e3c340d6c26865788a5980826a1c8e by @julianoes ", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2611/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2611/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3067313570", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2611#issuecomment-3067313570", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2611", "id": 3067313570, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s62032i", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-07-13T21:33:54Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-13T21:34:27Z", "body": "Oh dear, sorry about that. And thanks for the issue. Clearly, I didn't review this carefully enough.\n\nI'll fix or revert it this week. Unless you beat me to it with a pull request.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR"